classDiagram
    note for Locker "全局 APM 锁（ADR-003）：Search 在 Cloud 查询前释放；Cloud List 不获取；installed List 从 Recover、实时 Warn、Refresh 到全部 Config reads 后成功 Release"
    class Locker {
        <<interface>>
        +Acquire() (Unlock, error)
    }

    note for Unlock "锁句柄：持有者负责 Release；进程崩溃时内核自动释放"
    class Unlock {
        <<interface>>
        +Release() error
    }

    note for flockLocker "flock(2) 实现：单一全局锁文件（类似 apt 的 /var/lib/dpkg/lock）"
    class flockLocker {
        +Acquire() (Unlock, error)
    }

    flockLocker ..|> Locker
    Locker --> Unlock : returns
